index rows:
| Alert | Static feedback banner that stays on the page, with a sentiment color set | Use when the message must remain readable where it is; not for short post-action confirmations | [alert.md](alert.md) |
| Toast | Short-lived post-action message pushed through a provider and rendered by a single `<Toaster />` | Use to confirm something that happened; not when the user must read or act — use Alert or Dialog | [toast.md](toast.md) |
| Meter | Measured value in a known range (and family sibling Progress for running tasks) | Use when the number means something on its own; use Progress when something runs to completion | [meter.md](meter.md) |
